config UNISOC_SIPC_VIRT_BUS
	tristate "Unisoc IPC Virt Bus"
	default n
	help
	  sipc virt bus driver implementation for the Unisoc platform.
	  it is used to populating sub-devices.

	  Say M here if you want to build a module, also you
	  can set Y in none-GKI projects.
